@startuml 09-voice-tactical-command-to-be

' Model: To-Be
' UE baseline: dead903156946ec6956342f02d587612baab1717
' AI service baseline: f548c1ad64c5d284eace084132616d171d45403f
' Evidence: DOC-GDD-001, DOC-PROTO-002, UE-VOICE-001, UE-CMD-001,
'           UE-ORDER-001, PY-API-SPEECH-001, PY-API-TACTICAL-001,
'           PY-RECEIPT-001
' Planned gaps: GAP-BP-001, GAP-BP-002, GAP-BP-003

title 语音战术命令端到端目标时序（To-Be）

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #F8E7C4
  BorderColor #8A5A20
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #9A7B16
}

actor 玩家 as User
participant "主要玩家 Blueprint" as PlayerBP
control "UVoiceCaptureComponent\n<<existing>>" as Voice
control "UCommandServiceSubsystem\n<<partly existing>>" as Gateway
control "CombatContext Builder\n<<planned>>" as ContextBuilder
boundary "POST /v1/speech/transcribe\n<<backend existing; UE not connected>>" as SpeechApi
boundary "POST /v1/tactical/command\n<<backend existing; UE not connected>>" as TacticalApi
control "Typed Decision Parser / Adapter\n<<planned>>" as Adapter
control "UTacticalOrderComponent\n<<existing>>" as Order
control "Alice Ability Executor + GAS\n<<planned>>" as Executor
boundary "战术反馈 UI\n<<planned>>" as Feedback
boundary "POST /v1/tactical/executions\n<<backend existing; UE not connected>>" as ReceiptApi

User -> PlayerBP : 按住 Push-to-talk
PlayerBP -> Voice : StartRecording()
User -> PlayerBP : 松开 Push-to-talk
PlayerBP -> Voice : StopRecording()
Voice --> PlayerBP : OnRecordingFinished(WavData)

PlayerBP -> Gateway : SubmitVoiceTacticalCommand(WavData) <<planned>>
Gateway -> SpeechApi : multipart WAV + request_id
SpeechApi --> Gateway : text + confidence + language

alt 转写失败或置信度不足
  Gateway --> Feedback : 显示失败 / 请求玩家重述
else 得到可用文本
  Gateway -> ContextBuilder : CaptureCombatContext()
  ContextBuilder --> Gateway : CombatContext + encounter_id + snapshot_id
  Gateway -> TacticalApi : text + CombatContext
  TacticalApi --> Gateway : ResolveResponse / TacticalDecision
  Gateway -> Adapter : 解析并校验协议、request/encounter/snapshot

  alt decision 非 actionable 或响应过期
    Adapter --> Feedback : 显示解释 / 建议 / 澄清
  else actionable
    Adapter -> Order : TryAcceptOrder(mapped FTacticalOrder)

    alt 本地订单校验拒绝
      Order --> Adapter : false + FailureReason
      Adapter --> Feedback : 显示拒绝原因
      Adapter -> ReceiptApi : rejected receipt
    else 订单接受
      Order --> Adapter : true
      Adapter --> Feedback : companion_reply + accepted
      Adapter -> ReceiptApi : accepted receipt

      Executor -> Order : 读取活动订单并等待触发条件
      Executor -> Order : ValidateActiveOrderAtTrigger(...)
      alt 触发时复核失败 / 订单过期
        Order --> Executor : false + FailureReason
        Executor -> Order : CancelActiveOrder(Reason)
        Executor -> ReceiptApi : rejected / expired / cancelled receipt
        Executor --> Feedback : 显示未执行原因
      else 触发时复核通过
        Order --> Executor : true
        Executor -> Executor : GameplayTag → GAS Ability\n检查资源、冷却、状态并激活
        alt GAS 激活或执行失败
          Executor -> Order : CancelActiveOrder(Reason)
          Executor -> ReceiptApi : rejected receipt
        else 实际能力完成
          Executor -> Order : CompleteActiveOrder()
          Executor -> ReceiptApi : executed receipt
          Executor --> Feedback : 可读执行结果
        end
      end
    end
  end
end

note over PlayerBP,Gateway
  当前 As-Is 已有 Push-to-talk → ParseVoiceCommand；
  本图改为 v0.2 的“转写 + 上下文决策”目标链路。
end note

note over Adapter,Executor
  Python 只提出候选动作；UE 保留最终权威。
  后端 ability_id 必须经项目映射为 GameplayTag，
  由 GAS 再检查资源、冷却、标签和合法激活。
end note

note over Order,Executor
  这段接线目前尚未实现：Alice EventGraph 为空，
  BT_Alice 当前只跟随玩家。图中全部明确标为 planned。
end note

@enduml
